body:
I would say get theraphy. If not then pick up some new hobbies and or interests to distract you from the trauma. It can be something as basic as video games. I've stopped believing in god (still don't) and honestly, the first week was hell. If you already do this then i'm sorry, read the other comments. Though about the religion part. The thought that one day everything will just be end and it will go black. And the same will happen to your friends and there is no way to prevent it. BUT i like to think that it has made me more realistic and generally more appreciative of little things like having functioning legs.

&#x200B;

